msgctxt "whats-new:1.4:Parent"
msgid "### New Features\n- **Language Dialog**: You can search for a language by its English name as well as its localized name.\n- **Remaing Time Reminders**: Added default critical reminders in child session. Reminders can show in full-screen apps and can be customized, or completely removed, in child preferences.\n- **Parent App**: Revoke dialog shows list of running soft blocked apps that will be terminated.\n- **Parent App**: Face lifting:) Smoother app loading experience; Neat app list loading overlay with percentage progress.\n- **What's New**: Added metadata-driven What's new infra for parent and child app. Parent version offers everything (no mercy to to parents, Grr!); child version only offers carefully crafted content relevant and appropriate to them (we're responsible parents, aren't we all?)\n- **Request Time Form**: You can customize the preset times in preferences!\n- **Request Time Form**: You can select between minutes and hours as custom value unit (feature asked by my son. Upon a glad nodding, he asked, daddy, it'd be cool to add seconds and days, before being yelled at \"out, before I kick you cute little butt, again!\")\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- **Installation**: Fixed package-trigger errors after a denied kiosk login on Ubuntu and Fedora, and when a child's screen time is exhausted.\n- **Kiosk**: Fixed unintended desktop access by restricting the kiosk account to the request app and its required services.\n- **Kiosk**: Fixed startup failures when unrelated installed applications have writable data directories.\n- **Kiosk**: Fixed a Fedora startup crash caused by missing GPU rendering permission.\n- **Child App**: Fixed countdown freezes during continuous use and premature screen locking after inactivity.\n- **Child App**: Fixed the desktop staying locked after successful authentication when more screen time has been granted.\n- **Screen Time**: Fixed unnecessary error reports after unlocking and improved recovery from temporary timer-service failures.\n- **Broker**: Fixed startup failures caused by temporary trust-database lock contention and preserved bounded dependency diagnostics after service recovery without collecting personal data.\n- **Broker**: Added automatic recovery when the fapolicyd service exits with an error.\n- **Parent App**: Parent app app grid column headers on some RTL languages overlap\n- **Parent App**: Fixed the disabled Revoke button at zero remaining time when soft-blocked apps are still running, allowing parents to close those apps after the child’s session locks.\n- **Child App**: In Kiosk session, hitting enter in after typing custom value does not trigger auth dialog\n\n### Non Product Changes\n- Increased e2e coverage to 46. Fedora is covered, no double counting.\n\n### Fedora Workstation 44 Readiness\n- **Manaul Testing:** Old daddy magically dug out an even older Surface Laptop, and miraculously installed Fedora 44 on it. At the end of the day, VMs don't replace the touch and feel on a real computer (remember the v1.1 bug fix?). 5 bug fixes later, it's working!\n- **Test Automation:** One big step closer - Fedora automation just got a promotion to 1st class citizen, its coverage is on par with Ubuntu. Fedora release is on the horizon!!!\n\n\n"
msgstr "### Yangi imkoniyatlar\n- **Til tanlash oynasi**: Tilni inglizcha nomi hamda mahalliy nomi boʻyicha qidirishingiz mumkin.\n- **Qolgan vaqt haqidagi eslatmalar**: Bola seansida sukut boʻyicha koʻrsatiladigan kritik eslatmalar qoʻshildi. Eslatmalar toʻliq ekranli ilovalarda koʻrsatilishi mumkin va ularni bola sozlamalarida moslashtirish yoki butunlay olib tashlash mumkin.\n- **Ota-ona ilovasi**: Ruxsatni bekor qilish oynasi vaqtincha ruxsat berish mumkin boʻlgan bloklangan ilovalar orasidan hozir ishlayotgan va yopiladigan ilovalar roʻyxatini koʻrsatadi.\n- **Ota-ona ilovasi**: Yangi qiyofa:) Ilovaning yuklanishi yanada ravonlashdi; ilovalar roʻyxati yuklanayotganda bajarilish foizini koʻrsatadigan chiroyli ustki qatlam qoʻshildi.\n- **Yangiliklar**: Ota-ona va bola ilovalari uchun metamaʼlumotlarga asoslangan Yangiliklar infratuzilmasi qoʻshildi. Ota-onalar versiyasida hammasi bor (ota-onalarga rahm-shafqat yoʻq, Grr!); bolalar versiyasida esa faqat ularga tegishli va mos boʻlgan, puxta tayyorlangan mazmun bor (axir hammamiz masʼuliyatli ota-onalarmiz, shunday emasmi?)\n- **Vaqt soʻrash shakli**: Oldindan belgilangan vaqtlarni sozlamalarda moslashtirishingiz mumkin!\n- **Vaqt soʻrash shakli**: Maxsus qiymat birligi sifatida daqiqa yoki soatni tanlashingiz mumkin (bu imkoniyatni oʻgʻlim soʻragan edi. Xursand boʻlib bosh irgʻaganimdan keyin, u: «Dada, soniya va kunlarni ham qoʻshsak zoʻr boʻlardi», dedi. Shunda unga: «Chiq, yana shirin mitti dumbangga tepki yemasdan oldin!» deb baqirishdi)\n\n\n### Xatolarni tuzatish\n- **Oʻrnatish**: Ubuntu va Fedora tizimlarida kiosk hisobiga kirish rad etilgandan keyin hamda bolaning ekran vaqti tugaganda yuzaga keladigan paket triggeri xatolari tuzatildi.\n- **Kiosk**: Kiosk hisobi faqat soʻrov ilovasi va unga kerakli xizmatlar bilan cheklanib, ish stoliga koʻzda tutilmagan kirish imkoniyati bartaraf etildi.\n- **Kiosk**: Boshqa oʻrnatilgan ilovalarning maʼlumotlar kataloglariga yozish mumkin boʻlganda yuzaga keladigan ishga tushirish xatolari tuzatildi.\n- **Kiosk**: Fedora tizimida GPU orqali tasvir chizish ruxsati yoʻqligi sababli yuzaga kelgan ishga tushishdagi ishdan chiqish tuzatildi.\n- **Bola ilovasi**: Uzluksiz foydalanish paytida teskari sanoqning qotib qolishi va faoliyatsizlikdan keyin ekranning muddatidan oldin qulflanishi tuzatildi.\n- **Bola ilovasi**: Qoʻshimcha ekran vaqti berilganda muvaffaqiyatli autentifikatsiyadan keyin ish stolining qulflangan holda qolishi tuzatildi.\n- **Ekran vaqti**: Qulf ochilgandan keyingi keraksiz xato xabarlari bartaraf etildi va taymer xizmatining vaqtinchalik nosozliklaridan tiklanish yaxshilandi.\n- **Broker**: Ishonch maʼlumotlar bazasining vaqtinchalik qulf toʻqnashuvlari sababli yuzaga kelgan ishga tushirish xatolari tuzatildi va xizmat tiklangandan keyin bogʻliqliklar boʻyicha cheklangan diagnostika maʼlumotlari shaxsiy maʼlumotlarni yigʻmasdan saqlab qolindi.\n- **Broker**: fapolicyd xizmati xato bilan toʻxtaganda avtomatik tiklash qoʻshildi.\n- **Ota-ona ilovasi**: Ayrim oʻngdan chapga yoziladigan tillarda Ota-ona ilovasidagi ilovalar jadvalining ustun sarlavhalari bir-birining ustiga tushardi\n- **Ota-ona ilovasi**: Qolgan vaqt nolga teng boʻlganda va vaqtincha ruxsat berish mumkin boʻlgan bloklangan ilovalar hali ham ishlayotganida «Bekor qilish» tugmasi faol boʻlmasligi tuzatildi. Endi ota-onalar bolaning seansi qulflangandan keyin ham ushbu ilovalarni yopishlari mumkin.\n- **Bola ilovasi**: Kiosk seansida maxsus qiymat kiritilgandan keyin Enter bosilganda autentifikatsiya oynasi ochilmaydi\n\n### Mahsulotga aloqador boʻlmagan oʻzgarishlar\n- e2e qamrovi 46 taga yetkazildi. Fedora ham qamrab olingan, takroran hisoblanmagan.\n\n### Fedora Workstation 44 uchun tayyorgarlik\n- **Qoʻlda sinash:** Qari dada sehrli tarzda undan ham eskiroq Surface Laptop topib oldi va unga moʻjizaviy ravishda Fedora 44 oʻrnatdi. Oxir-oqibat, virtual mashinalar haqiqiy kompyuterdagi ishlash hissini bera olmaydi (v1.1 dagi xato tuzatilganini eslaysizmi?). 5 ta xato tuzatilgach, ishlayapti!\n- **Testlarni avtomatlashtirish:** Maqsadga yana bir katta qadam yaqinlashdik — Fedora avtomatlashtirishi birinchi darajali maqomga koʻtarildi, uning qamrovi Ubuntu bilan tenglashdi. Fedora uchun reliz ufqda koʻrinmoqda!!!\n\n\n"

